	(text "Channels 1-8: 2x photoMOS contact closure (RESET, PWR BTN) per motherboard front-panel header. Floating outputs.\nTLP176AM: 3mA max trigger, ~6mA drive. U14 MCP23017 @0x20 sources the LED current: GPA0-7 = PWR_DRV1-8, GPB0-7 = RST_DRV1-8 (GPA7/GPB7 are output-only).\nR32 holds U14 in reset unless the MCU drives EXP_nRESET high: MCU reset/hang -> all GPIO Hi-Z -> all buttons released.\nEXP_nRESET / EXP_INT are shared with extra MCP23017 modules on the expansion header (INT open-drain, mirrored)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
